OL,3,AGambia to pay victims of Yahya Jammeh's
OL,4,Arule from proceeds of his seized US
OL,5,Amansion
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Gambia will use funds received from
OL,8,Fthe US from the forfeiture of long-time
OL,9,Fruler Yahya Jammeh's property to pay
OL,10,Fvictims of his rule, authorities have
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe Gambia's Reparations Commission
OL,14,Fsaid it received $2.5m (#1.86m) from
OL,15,Fthe sale of a mansion in Maryland owned
OL,16,Fby former leader of the West African
OL,17,Fnation.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
