OL,3,AGambia to pay victims of Yahya Jammeh's
OL,4,Arule from proceeds of his seized US
OL,5,Amansion
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US had in 2022 secured the right to
OL,8,Fsell the property on grounds that it
OL,9,Fwas acquired through "criminal proceeds
OL,10,Fand misappropriated Gambian public
OL,11,Ffunds".
OL,13,FJammeh ruled The Gambia for more than
OL,14,F20 years after taking over in a coup in
OL,15,F1994 - a time marked by allegations of
OL,16,Fhuman rights abuses forced
OL,17,Fdisappearances and extrajudicial
OL,18,Fkillings.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
